    "title": "Staging: Check the way in, to find what asks for the password",
    "why": "Open staging still meets the browser's password prompt after release #3. Rather than guess again, the Staging page gets Check the way in: it asks staging for a page with nothing, with the pass, with the checks' sign-in and along the whole Open staging path, and says which layer answered each (the web server, staging's guard file or the page, now marked with X-Tv-Stg-Gate). It also shows staging's rules on the way down, .user.ini, the guard file, the pass's shape and what staging's own PHP sees (/api/stg-probe.php), never a secret. decisions/0159 step 1, part 1: the fix follows from what it finds.",
